{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.9\",\"notes\":\"5.0.9 — Kovan beta 0.1.4: League Asistanı rün önerisi güçlendirildi. counterpick.lol'da eşleşme yalnız ters yönde varsa o da denenir, rünler metinden de okunur; kendi maç geçmişindeki rün seçimlerinden öneri; istemcinin önerdiği rün sayfası yedek; rün bulunamazsa nedeni kartta gösterilir.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-06T15:16:20.354Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"7fea0304533d8bc0a847a389e548ae94800f0da769b9d42baa17e7b80d582d02\",\"size\":1408025},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"9473bd8e7204386bd9cd5984d9f0b70a1c90f3c0df4a2bd29508d8300cef0ff5\",\"size\":323744},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"c78d003581df35b82c4805da86ab0f842e76db869df60691aabaaf85f552fc7f\",\"size\":8262},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"72WR0gg5XglBcK4jq/X1Q0FoeyqBts/zea3qQECcM6C6w1QT1UGFZKM95h99vZu5+qDDd4zMInbKB1VxhqXUBQ==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}